    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi Alex, hi Casey,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Here's where we've landed for the team offsite on <b>November 5&ndash;6</b> at the Riverside venue (Room B both days):<ul><li>Travel: please book by <b>October 20</b> through the travel portal: <a href=\"https://example.com/travel\">https://example.com/travel</a></li><li>Hotel: the room block is held until October 23 (booking code OFFSITE26)</li><li>Dietary requirements: send them to me by October 16</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Could you two own the agenda for day 2? A rough draft by Thursday would be great.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Avery</div></body></html>"
